[
  {
    "id": 0,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "――文化祭当日",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "—The day of the cultural festival"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "字幕",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Caption"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 1,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ここが噂のＶＲカフェか",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "So this is the famous VR café?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "来場者Ａ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Visitor A"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 2,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "うおっ、すごい行列！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Whoa, look at that line!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "来場者Ｂ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Visitor B"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 3,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ただいま３０分待ちでーす！\n待ってる人は１列に並んでくださーい！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Current wait time is 30 minutes! Please form a single line!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ハイディ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Heidi"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 4,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "はい、次の人！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Next, please!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ハイディ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Heidi"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 5,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "やっほー",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Heyooo!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ライザ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Ryza"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 6,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "盛況みたいですね",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Looks like business is booming."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "クラウディア",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Klaudia"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 7,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "おお、お二人さん。いらっしゃい。\nじゃあこのゴーグルを着けてね",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Oh, if it isn't you two. Welcome! Here, put these goggles on."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ハイディ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Heidi"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 8,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "おおー！\u3000カッコいい！\nあたしこういうの初めてなんだよねー",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Whoooa! These look so cool! This is my first time trying something like this!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ライザ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Ryza"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 9,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ふふっ、私も。行こ、ライザ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Hehe, mine too. Shall we, Ryza?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "クラウディア",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Klaudia"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 10,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "わっ、本当にカフェの中にいるみたい！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Wow, it really feels like we're in a café!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ライザ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Ryza"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 11,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "うん！\u3000すごいね！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Yes! This is incredible!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "クラウディア",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Klaudia"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 12,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "いらっしゃいませ。こちらのお席へどうぞ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Welcome! Please, this way to your table."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "フロッケ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Flocke"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 13,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "すごい……味も香りも本物みたい",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Amazing... the taste and aroma seem so real."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "クラウディア",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Klaudia"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 14,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "なんか不思議な感覚……！\nどういう仕組みなの！？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "It's such a weird sensation...! How does it work?!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ライザ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Ryza"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 15,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ええと……簡単にいえば、味や香り、温度を感じる時の\n脳波の動きを参考に、電波を用いて疑似的に再現を――",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Well... to put it simply, we studied the brain wave patterns that occur when tasting, smelling, and feeling temperature, then used electromagnetic waves to artificially recreate those sensations—"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "フロッケ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Flocke"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 16,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "うーん……？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Hmm...?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ライザ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Ryza"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 17,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "す、すみません。分かりづらかったですか？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I-I'm sorry! Was that too technical?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "フロッケ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Flocke"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 18,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "いや、ごめん。あたしの学がないだけ……\nとにかくすごいってことは分かった！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "No, sorry. It went over my head... But even I get that there's some amazing technology under the hood!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ライザ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Ryza"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 19,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "うーん！\u3000あまーい！\n太らずにケーキ食べ放題なんて最高……！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Mmm! This is so sweet! An all-you-can-eat cake without gaining weight...?! This is heaven!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ロロナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Rorona"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 20,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "科学の力ってすげー！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "The power of science is freakin' awesome!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "来場者Ｃ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Visitor C"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 21,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "不安だったんですけど、\nちゃんとお客さんが来てくれてよかったです",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I was worried, but I'm glad we're getting customers."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "フロッケ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Flocke"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 22,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "それどころか、すでに学園中で話題になってて、\n外はすごい行列になってましたよ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "You're doing more than getting a few customers—it's already the talk of the school. There's quite a line forming outside."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "クラウディア",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Klaudia"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 23,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "そ、そうなんですか！\nそれはそれで緊張してきました……",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "R-really?! Now I'm getting nervous..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "フロッケ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Flocke"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 24,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "あっ、次のお客さんが！\u3000行ってきます！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Oh! More customers! I'll be right back!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "フロッケ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Flocke"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 25,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "頑張れー",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Good luck!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ライザ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Ryza"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 26,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "あっ、校長先生！\u3000いらっしゃいませ。\nお一人だと相席になるのですが大丈夫ですか？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Oh, Headmaster! Welcome. Would you mind sharing a table? We're quite full at the moment."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "フロッケ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Flocke"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 27,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ああ、構わない",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "That's fine."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アウグスト",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "August"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 28,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "あら、どうも",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "My, hello there."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ザスキア",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Saskia"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 29,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "……ふん",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "...Hmph."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アウグスト",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "August"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 30,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "……ほう。仮想現実で味覚、嗅覚、触覚の再現は\n困難だと思っていたが……なかなかよくできている",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "...Impressive. I had thought recreating taste, smell, and touch in virtual reality would be challenging... but this is quite well done."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アウグスト",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "August"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 31,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "正直、私も驚いたわ。\n科学学校のレベルもなかなかのものね",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I must admit, I'm surprised too. The Science Academy is certainly living up to its name."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ザスキア",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Saskia"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 32,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "……これほどのものを作れる天才は、\nうちの学校でも一握りだがな",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "...Though even at our academy, only a handful of geniuses could have created something of this caliber."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アウグスト",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "August"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 33,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "だが、技術革新というものは、往々にして\nそのような天才の手によって為されるものだ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Technological innovation is often achieved through the hands of such rare talents."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アウグスト",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "August"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 34,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "まるで他人事みたいにいうのね。\n……あなたは昔からそうだったけれど",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "You speak as if it has nothing to do with you. You haven't changed at all."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ザスキア",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Saskia"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 35,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "…………",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アウグスト",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "August"
        }
      }
    }
  }
]